  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38989b43b1e684fbbb8e79ec001b0324, type: 3}
  m_Name: SharkTankPitch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  speakers: 0000000000000000030000000000000000000000020000000400000000000000040000000300000000000000
  randomSpeakerName: 
  randomSpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogue:
  - "Hi Sharks, I\u2019m Finnley, creator of LinkedFin and I\u2019m seeking 100,000
    sand dollars for a 10% equity stake in my company."
  - LinkedFin is a professional networking app that allows businesses and recruiters
    to easily connect with talent.
  - "Isn\u2019t that what everyone is doing right now at this conference?"
  - "Well yes, but it\u2019s much easier to get your resume out to multiple companies
    on your phone than to wait in line at every booth here."
  - And on LinkedFin you can keep your profile up to date with your latest resume
    and headshot.
  - "Juveniles and pups can friend each other and trade pictures on social networks.
    You want grownup professionals to friend each other over the web? That\u2019ll
    never work. I\u2019m out."
  - "What\u2019s your current user base?"
  - "Well right now it\u2019s just me and some of my fellow business school alum."
  - "I\u2019ll need to see some traction before I could even think to invest. I\u2019m
    out."
  - "Sorry Finnley, I just don\u2019t see how your app could ever replace ReefCon.
    Thanks for coming in today."
  - Thank you, sharks.
  options: []
